===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Roaring Skies|Xatu|29}} from the {{TCG|Roaring Skies}} expansion.
*'''Life Drain''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Gym Challenge|Sabrina's Kadabra|58}} from the {{TCG|Gym Challenge}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

